{
  "doc": "Ch8 'The Seawall' (M3-C08-02; docs/kb/story/beats/act1_ch08.md B01-B18; docs/kb/tech/chapter_flow.md 'Ch8'). Two greybox zones, played by ZoneStory: ch08/corrow (Ch08Zone; day, storm and aftermath by flags) and ch08/coilspire (Ch08CoilspireZone; the headland path, the keeper's hut, the flue trial, the crown). ENTRY: Ch7's leave beat hands off to ch08/corrow at Mole (also the location's own spawn). B01 on the first arrival: the chapter becomes 8, Kerrid says 'Later.' and a party step drops him (Rhen, Asha, Toma; Ysolde and Liss in reserve). B02: Ivo on the wall-head at the top of the mole (critical: ch08_met_ivo), Asha at the stair-head (wordless), four barks, the shrine and the chandler. B04: the wall-gate (needs ch08_met_ivo) goes to ch08/coilspire at PathFoot: the headland path's random fights and its forced fight at the mid-point, Fenn's side scene at the hearth (B03, optional, before the door), the Tender at the door. B05: the flue trial (the zone root: four tiers; tier 2's side flue gives the needle; tier 3's seized key plays the stuck_key beat, Liss and the mark) and two placed fights. B06-B07: the binding at the crown, the storm against the wind, and the great key (the player's one input), then back to ch08/corrow at WallGate in the storm. THE SET PIECE (act1_ch08.md §5a; set_piece_battles.md): B08-B09 then Wave 1 (autosave at B09: checkpoint WallHead); each fight returns to WallHead, and the next arrival row mends the party (at least ch08_field.json mend.hp_pct HP), plays the beat between and opens the next fight: B11 the hoist -> Wave 2; B13 the stranger on the wall -> Wave 3; B15 'Captain?' and B16's intro -> the Undertow's Reach (scripted_escape). Every set-piece battle step carries objective_flag ch08_stair_groups_up (the stair meter: FieldBattle adds the engine's objective_count after the fight and puts it back on 'Fight again'). Battle parties are the sim suites' (tools/balance/targets.json ch08_*). After the Reach: B17 the wall falls (the choice), B18 the cut rope, then Kerrid is written back into the reserve and the party goes down to the strand: EXIT ch09/corrow_night at Strand. Field fights: the headland path's random table and its forced fight are ch08_headland_gulls (two stormgulls; Rhen's) and ch08_headland_crabs (two wallcrabs; Toma's); the spire's two placed fights are ch08_flue_moths (Ysolde's frost), all with sim.py bands.",
